<section class="section"><div class="page-width product-page"><div class="product-gallery">{% for image in product.images %}<div class="product-media">{{ image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy' }}</div>{% else %}<div class="product-media placeholder-product"><span>CHAVÉR</span></div>{% endfor %}</div><div class="product-info"><div class="eyebrow">FOUNDATIONS COLLECTION</div><h1>{{ product.title }}</h1>{% if product.price > 0 %}<div class="product-price">{{ product.price | money }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="product-description">{{ product.description }}</div>{% unless product.has_only_default_variant %}<div class="product-options"><div class="eyebrow">Available variants</div>{% for option in product.options_with_values %}<div class="product-option"><strong>{{ option.name }}</strong><div class="option-values">{% for value in option.values %}<span>{{ value }}</span>{% endfor %}</div></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% endunless %}<div class="product-facts"><details open><summary>Product details</summary><div class="details-copy"><p>Premium construction, refined proportions and an everyday silhouette developed for the CHAVÉR FOUNDATIONS COLLECTION.</p></div></details><details><summary>Fit & sizing</summary><div class="details-copy"><p>Designed around a balanced oversized fit. View the <a href="/pages/size-guide">size guide</a> for guidance before launch.</p></div></details><details><summary>Care</summary><div class="details-copy"><p>Care instructions will be confirmed with the final production specification. View our <a href="/pages/customer-care">customer care</a> page for general guidance.</p></div></details></div><div class="launch-note"><strong>COMING Q1 2027</strong><p>This piece is currently in development. Ordering opens only after final sample, fit and quality approval.</p></div><a class="btn btn-solid" href="#chaver-newsletter">Join for early access</a><p class="microcopy">No payment is taken. Newsletter subscribers receive launch information first.</p></div></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Main product","settings":[]}{% endschema %}